      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而从风水的角度来看，北港火山远征的\n方位是非常危险的凶位。\n小林历奇很后悔自己只字不提就送走了她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754e32bc67cb387c582a912ea037fcca78f331880401780c4526374a006190aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
